  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting the rights of people with disabilities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project objective is to enhance institutional capacity of organization of PwD and Government to plan, budget, implement and monitor disability-inclusive programmes. It will also focus on promotion of human rights of persons with disabilities, with focus on culture for behavior change, education and economic empowerment.</narrative>
  </description>
